{"slug":"Project-Delta-GOD-MODE-FOR-DELTA-242059","_id":"6a4fd8779f8807fd0fc57370","title":"GOD MODE FOR DELTA","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77de2","gameId":7336302630,"name":"Project Delta","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-b626d6660dab91962d3f47e05f7bebb2-a36be43125db.png","placeId":7336302630},"features":"-# by templehook / peke\n# Project delta godmode leak\nThe goyim are taking pride in their stupid little 1 liner bullshit vulns anyone can find in 2 mins, and thats their only selling point for their pasted scripts.\n\n- Run it after you spawned in fully and equipped the gun you wish to use for that raid\n- Switching to any other gun/item will not work after ur in godmode and will break ur hotbar making you unable to equip anything else again (Stims, meds, consumables, grenades, etc, are considered items too so using them will break your game)\n- Cant be disabled unless you reset.\n- You CANNOT: extract, open doors, noclip, tp, speed, etc.\n- You CAN: loot, drop, damage others.\n- Recommended to bring someone in the raid with you, who will extract your stuff, you can reset for them to loot you as well\n- AI will ignore you.\n- Probably has more issues but i didnt test it any more cause i cba to spend 1 more second in this fucking shitty game.\n-# again all credits to peke :3\n\n@everyone\n\ntags\nproject delta\nPROJECT DELTA\nROJECT DELTA\nDELTA PROJECT\nDELTA\nPD\npd\ndelta project\nroject delta\nproject\ndelta","tags":["GOD MODE","PROJECT DELTA"],"script":"local Client = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\n\nlocal Character = Client.Character\n\nlocal Humanoid = Character.Humanoid\n\nHumanoid:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"Health\"):Connect(function()\n\n    if Humanoid.Health ~= Humanoid.Health then\n\n        Humanoid.Health = 100\n\n    end\n\nend) -- this is just so that the game's client doesnt error, you can do it in a hook but it wont wark zolara\n\nCharacter.Health.Drowning:FireServer(\"NaN\")","owner":{"_id":"688223024ffae2622a5a179f","username":"Vasli","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/688223024ffae2622a5a179f-1764841826922.png","status":"offline","id":"688223024ffae2622a5a179f","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":5390,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-090d60e1fa3266f9c6b98b774523eda7-93bb08857c86.png","likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":4,"createdAt":"2026-07-09T17:20:55.273Z","keyLink":"","executes":255,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a4fd8779f8807fd0fc57372","editBy":{"_id":"688223024ffae2622a5a179f","username":"Vasli","status":"offline","id":"688223024ffae2622a5a179f"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-07-09T17:20:55.276Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a5000dfc365addbd19557c6","commentBy":{"_id":"6a4ffee7470cbdd9160f6856","username":"Darkbleyder150","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","lastActive":"2026-07-09T20:24:57.263Z","createdAt":"2026-07-09T20:04:55.148Z","status":"offline","id":"6a4ffee7470cbdd9160f6856"},"text":"Cómo uso esos scripts en el juego alguien me puede pasar un tutorial","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-09T20:13:19.170Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6a5340350a0aee096e614f2c","commentBy":{"_id":"6a533c9557608b6d32e31676","username":"amazuevkirill","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","lastActive":"2026-07-12T07:24:25.793Z","createdAt":"2026-07-12T07:04:53.033Z","status":"offline","id":"6a533c9557608b6d32e31676"},"text":"@Darkbleyder150 самому узнать охото","parent":{"_id":"6a5000dfc365addbd19557c6","commentBy":{"_id":"6a4ffee7470cbdd9160f6856","username":"Darkbleyder150","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6a4ffee7470cbdd9160f6856"},"text":"Cómo uso esos scripts en el juego alguien me puede pasar un tutorial"},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislike